{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117749","id":3433014386,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Mn6Ry","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117749","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117749.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117749.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117749","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117749/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117749/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117749/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/180e72bec666e9341b65ccee666ef31542208777","number":117749,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"HTTPClient: Wait for available data in blocking mode","user":{"login":"j20001970","id":71766835,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNzY2ODM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71766835?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970","html_url":"https://github.com/j20001970","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/j20001970/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for new contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n-->\r\n\r\nFixes #33479, fixes #35868, fixes #118666 and high CPU usage when performing HTTP requests with `HTTPRequest` using threads.\r\n\r\nWhen using `HTTPRequest.request` with `use_threads` setting to true, which configures its `HTTPClient` to enable blocking mode internally, most of CPU time is wasted on reading zero byte from `StreamPeer::get_partial_data` loop in `HTTPClientTCP::_get_http_data`[[1]](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/65e73b3a5eec19e3269809b0f00e73a646723067/core/io/http_client_tcp.cpp#L747).\r\n\r\nSince `StreamPeer::get_data` cannot be used (reason already stated in the comment of `HTTPClientTCP::_get_http_data`), and `StreamPeer::get_partial_data` is a non-blocking method, meaning it returns immediately regardless of the bytes actually read, most of the time there are no data available even with very fast internet connection in a tight loop.\r\n\r\nThis PR made the following change to fix the problem:\r\n\r\n- Use `StreamPeerTCP::wait` in `HTTPClientTCP::_get_http_data` when running in blocking mode. `StreamPeerTCP::get_available_bytes` returning 0 means that we should wait for available data rather than doing busy loop.\r\n- Add `HTTPClient::disconnect_from_host` that will only close the client connection socket without deleting it. When calling `HTTPRequest::cancel_request` with `use_threads=true`, this method will be called first before waiting for the thread to finish. This makes sure that:\r\n  1. `StreamPeerTCP::wait` will not stall during `HTTPRequest::cancel_request`, the wait should return after the socket is closed.\r\n  2. The client socket will not be deleted by `HTTPClient::close` before the thread is finished.\r\n\r\n  (Note that `HTTPClient::disconnect_from_host` has no effect on Web platform.)\r\n- `NetSocket::close` now shutdown the socket first before closing it. This change is to make sure `StreamPeerTCP::wait` does not stall when network is disconnected below application-level (cable unplug, turning off Wi-Fi).\r\n\r\nWith my profiling result using Tracy as reference:\r\nBefore:\r\n<img width=\"500\" height=\"600\" alt=\"before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b689bdfc-62d8-4ca6-9736-23aa23dd03de\" />\r\n<img width=\"1400\" height=\"600\" alt=\"stats_before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a459a6af-256b-4a12-8ba7-51ef3dafc110\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"500\" height=\"600\" alt=\"after\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/36e66601-f7f3-4711-8b10-1562bfe98edc\" />\r\n<img width=\"1400\" height=\"600\" alt=\"stats_after\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/360dbbcf-da07-4e36-b619-4d7bae837351\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":649800701,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2NDk4MDA3MDE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:network","name":"topic:network","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 